    "chunk_text": "Iwrn us was geswuteled \u00feurh witegie and erendrache \u00feat God wolde man becume al for ure sache. Do\u00f0 god for his lufe, cume\u00f0 bli\u00f0eliche to chirche, ouer seruise to herenne swa wile God \u00feat ge moten. God almihti \u00fee his fader and sune and holi gost, on \u00fereo wise to dai his michele mihte swetelede. \u00deat giue he eu chnawe his \u00fereomnesse, and mihtte and streng\u00fee wel to donne, swa giue Crist us alle, Ure Drihte nehlechende his passiun, isohte \u00fereo stedes \u00feider ward, and \u00feat was \u00fee feor\u00f0e. \u00deat he lede ey on domes d\u00e6i into heuenriche \u00fee o schal ileste. Abacuc \u00fee prophet witegede of \u00fee hechnesse of \u00feisse deige michel er he icume were. Ac al hit was to dai iturnd to blisse \u00feurh his upstigunge. For \u00feider he haue\u00f0 ila\u00f0ed us ealle to astige, swa wille God \u00feat we mote. \u00d0e holi witege David \u00fee was king of Ierusalem meni hundred wintre er \u00fean ure Drihte mon bicome. Crist gife us mihte and stren\u00f0e \u00fees fower kinne teres to schedenne and \u00feer mide heuenriche bigeten. Muchel we owgie to wur\u00f0ienne \u00feisne dei \u00feat is sunne icliped, for hit is Godes ogie dei. \u00deider mote we cume \u00fear is wane of alle ifel and fille of iche gode. Wo is \u00fee men \u00fee wo is and me him mot bihat and mai and wile hit him ileste. And \u00feonne mei he God filie and efter him iwende to heouenriche and swa wile almihti God \u00feat we \u00dee heuenliche cwen u",
